# Multilingual grammar

- Treat `de`, `en`, `ru`, `uk` as independently localized — not literal translations.
- Preserve meaning, prices, legal facts, Leipzig relevance, links, brand spelling.
- Verify grammar/idiom per locale; no Russianisms in UK, no needless anglicisms in DE.
- Locale punctuation, quotes, dashes, NBSP, currency, dates.
- After multilingual HTML: `npm run lint` and `npm run check:links`.
